          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_26_equation_3.jpg",
          "content": "x - y = 1 0\\tag{1}"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.416,
            0.154,
            0.878,
            0.174
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_26_equation_4.jpg",
          "content": "10x - 10y = 101\\tag{2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.18,
            0.583,
            0.201
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Multiplying both sides of (1) by 10 gives"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.417,
            0.202,
            0.879,
            0.223
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_26_equation_6.jpg",
          "content": "10x - 10y = 100\\tag{3}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.229,
            0.882,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The left hand side in (2) and (3) are equal expressions, but the right hand side are not. Hence we cannot find values of x and y that satisfy both (2) and (3). Thus, this pair of equations has no solution!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.302,
            0.399,
            0.324
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Think and Reflect"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.338,
            0.853,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Give 3 more examples of pairs of equations that have no solution. Can you find a simple rule to check when this will happen?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.393,
            0.432,
            0.414
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When a pair of equations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.41,
            0.418,
            0.589,
            0.441
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_26_equation_11.jpg",
          "content": "a_{1}x + b_{1}y + c_{1} = 0"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.41,
            0.443,
            0.588,
            0.465
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_26_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "a_{2}x + b_{2}y + c_{2} = 0"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.465,
            0.881,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(with "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { _ 2 } , \\; b _ { _ 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "c _ { _ 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " all not equal to 0) is such that after suitable multiplications, we can make"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.195,
            0.503,
            0.762,
            0.523
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) the coefficients of x of both equations equal, and"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.523,
            0.712,
            0.544
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) the coefficients of y of both equations equal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.547,
            0.879,
            0.569
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "while the constants "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "c _ { \\mathrm { { _ 1 } } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "c _ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " remain unequal, the pair has no solution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.572,
            0.798,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "These conditions mean "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a_{1}=ka_{2},b_{1}=kb_{2},c_{1}\\neq kc_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , where "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "k \\neq 0"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.595,
            0.688,
            0.636
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hence, when "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{a_{1}}{a_{2}}=\\frac{b_{1}}{b_{2}} \\neq \\frac{c_{1}}{c_{2}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " the pair has no solution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.643,
            0.881,
            0.722
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { a _ { _ 1 } } { a _ { _ 2 } } { = } \\frac { b _ { _ 1 } } { b _ { _ 2 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , both the variables get eliminated during the Elimination Method. Based on what happens to the constants, the pair can either have an infinite number of solutions or no solution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.728,
            0.882,
            0.813
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We have already seen that when one of the variables remains during the Elimination Method, there exists a unique solution. This can happen only when "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { \\widetilde { a _ { _ { 1 } } }   \\neq   \\widetilde { b _ { _ { 1 } } } } { \\widetilde { a _ { _ { 2 } } } }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.821,
            0.619,
            0.842
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Summarising, we have the following cases:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.842,
            0.627,
            0.885
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. when "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { a _ { _ 1 } } { a _ { _ 2 } }   \\neq   \\frac { b _ { _ 1 } } { b _ { _ 2 } } ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " the pair has a unique solution,"
            }
          ]
        }
